ysical damage to an enemy target. Awards 1 combo point.",["referenceIcon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionAbilities\\inv_throwingknife_07"},{["id"]=26001193,["name"]="Smoke Bomb",["class"]="Rogue",["spec"]="Assassination",["kind"]="Ability",["quality"]="Legendary",["spells"]={954501},["ae"]=3,["te"]=0,["level"]=38,["rarityCost"]=2,["requiredAE"]=0,["requiredTE"]=0,["requiredIDs"]="",["ascensionReference"]=1193,["serverPending"]=true,["referenceDescription"]="Creates a cloud of thick smoke in an 8 yard radius around you for 5 sec. Enemies are unable to target into or out of the smoke cloud. Also, the caster take 40% less damage for 5 sec after using Smoke Bomb.\n\nThis ability is usable while shapeshifted.",["referenceIcon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionAbilities\\ability_rogue_smoke"},{["id"]=26001605,["name"]="Air Ascendance",["class"]="Shaman",["spec"]="Enhancement",["kind"]="Ability",["quality"]="Epic",["spells"]={954831},["ae"]=2,["te"]=0,["level"]=40,["rarityCost"]=1,["requiredAE"]=0,["requiredTE"]=0,["requiredIDs"]="",["ascensionReference"]=1605,["serverPending"]=true,["referenceDescription"]="You surrender your physical form to the power of the elements, transforming into a being of raw elemental energy for 15 sec. \n\nYour Stormstrike has a 30 yard range and deals extra Nature damage.\n\nThe cooldown of Stormstrike is reset when using any Shaman Shock, Lightning Bolt or Chain Lightning.",["referenceIcon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionAbilities\\spell_fire_elementaldevastation"},{["id"]=26001199,["name"]="Bind Elemental",["class"]="Shaman",["spec"]="Restoration",["kind"]="Ability",["quality"]="Rare",["spells"]={954520},["ae"]=2,["te"]=0,["level"]=20,["rarityCost"]=1,["requiredAE"]=0,["requiredTE"]=0,["requiredIDs"]="",["ascensionReference"]=1199,["serverPending"]=true,["referenceDescription"]="Binds the target hostile elemental for up to 50 sec. The bound unit is unable to move, attack or cast spells. Any damage caused will release the target. Only one target can be bound at a time.",["referenceIcon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionAbilities\\spell_shaman_bindelemental"},{["id"]=26001198,["name"]="Capacitor Totem",["class"]="Shaman",["spec"]="Elemental",["kind"]="Ability",["quality"]="Epic",["spells"]={954518},["ae"]=2,["te"]=0,["level"]=36,["rarityCost"]=1,["requiredAE"]=0,["requiredTE"]=0,["requiredIDs"]="",["ascensionReference"]=1198,["serverPending"]=true,["referenceDescription"]="Summons an Air totem with 5 health within 20 yards that gathers electrical energy from the surrounding air and then explodes after 2 sec to deal Nature damage and stun all enemies within 8 yards for 4 sec.\n\nDeals 300% increased damage versus targets permanently immune to stuns.\n\nThis ability is usable while shapeshifted.",["referenceIcon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionAbilities\\inv_staff_07"},{["id"]=26001626,["name"]="Cloudburst Totem",["class"]="Shaman",["spec"]="Restoration",["kind"]="Ability",["quality"]="Epic",["spells"]={760009},["ae"]=2,["te"]=0,["level"]=28,["rarityCost"]=1,["requiredAE"]=0,["requiredTE"]=0,["requiredIDs"]="",["ascensionReference"]=1626,["serverPending"]=true,["referenceDescription"]="Summons a totem at your feet with 5 health for 15 sec that collects power from all of your healing spells. When the totem expires or dies, the stored power is released, healing all injured allies within 40 yards for 30% of all Nature healing done while it was active, divided evenly among targets.\n\nCasting this spell a second time recalls the totem and releases the healing.",["referenceIcon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionAbilities\\ability_shaman_condensationtotem"},{["id"]=26001304,["name"]="Earthquake",["class"]="Shaman",["spec"]="Elemental",["kind"]="Ability",["quality"]="Epic",["spells"]={954524},["ae"]=2,["te"]=0,["level"]=20,["rarityCost"]=1,["requiredAE"]=0,["requiredTE"]=0,["requiredIDs"]="",["ascensionReference"]=1304,["serverPending"]=true,["referenceDescription"]="You cause the earth to tremble at your target location, dealing Nature damage every 1 sec to enemies within an 8 yard radius and reducing their movement speed by 25%. Lasts 8 sec.\n\nEnemies damaged by this ability are afflicted with Trembling. At 3 stacks, they are stunned for 3 seconds.\n\nThis effect can only occur once every 10 seconds from any Earthquake effect",["referenceIcon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionAbilities\\spell_shaman_earthquake"},{["id"]=26001613,["name"]="Elemental Blast",["class"]="Shaman",["spec"]="Elemental",["kind"]="Ability",["quality"]="Normal",["spells"]={954807},["ae"]=2,["te"]=0,["level"]=40,["rarityCost"]=0,["requiredAE"]=0,["requiredTE"]=0,["requiredIDs"]="",["ascensionReference"]=1613,["serverPending"]=true,["referenceDescription"]="Harness and direct the raw power of the elements towards an enemy target, dealing Elemental damage and increasing the caster's critical strike chance or spell casting speed for 8 seconds.",["referenceIcon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionAbilities\\shaman_talent_elementalblast"},{["id"]=26001625,["name"]="Flame Ascendance",["class"]="Shaman",["spec"]="Elemental",["kind"]="Ability",["quality"]="Epic",["spells"]={760000},["ae"]=2,["te"]=0,["level"]=34,["rarityCost"]=1,["requiredAE"]=0,["requiredTE"]=0,["requiredIDs"]="",["ascensionReference"]=1625,["serverPending"]=true,["referenceDescription"]="Transform into a being of raw elemental energy for 15 sec, casting Flame Shock on up to 10 nearby enemies within 10 yards if known. Chain Lightning becomes Lava Beam. Lava Burst's cooldown is reduced by 50%.\n\nLava Beam",["referenceIcon"]="Interface\\AddOns\\HeroFreePick\\Art\\AscensionAbilities\\spell_fire_elementaldevastation"},{["id"]=26001606,["name"]="Healing Rain",["class"]="Shaman",["spec"]="Restoration",["kind"]="Ability",["quality"]="Normal",["spells"]={954861},["ae"]=2,["te"]=0,["level"]=24,["rarityCost"]=0,["requi